        dcterms:description "Module and function docstrings map every equation to Mitchison (1980) Eqs. 2-6 & Figs. 1-2, Mitchison (1981) Eqs. 1-5, Feugier et al. (2005) Eqs. 1-9 & Figs. 3-7, Sachs (1981), and the 3 formal Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_034_auxin_canalization_leaf_veins.lean` (L1-39, L102-463)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
